cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these measurements or the eval harness, please cite this repository."
title: "strix-halo-llm: measured llama.cpp Vulkan tuning for AMD Strix Halo"
abstract: >-
  Measured tuning for local LLM inference on an AMD Ryzen AI MAX+ 395 "Strix Halo"
  (Radeon 8060S, gfx1151) with 128 GB of unified memory: llama.cpp Vulkan launchers,
  depth-aware benchmarks, and a private two-suite evaluation harness. Every figure was
  measured on the box, with its context depth, quant, backend and build attached, and
  claims that did not survive measurement are kept alongside their refutation.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Anatoly
    family-names: Lazarev
repository-code: "https://github.com/lazarevtill/strix-halo-llm"
url: "https://strix.lazarev.cloud/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - llama.cpp
  - Vulkan
  - Strix Halo
  - gfx1151
  - local inference
  - unified memory
  - benchmarking
  - LLM evaluation
